# Search backend for the Generic Data Index (Studio trees/search). The 2026
# dev-compose ships an opensearch service; pimcore/opensearch-client reads this
# as %env(default::PIMCORE_OPENSEARCH_DSN)%, so it is optional by construction.
#
# Deliberately not in .env: the Generic Data Index bundle re-declares the client
# DSN from this variable in its own prepend(), which wins over anything the app
# config sets, and Pimcore's installer re-reads the .env files with
# overrideExistingVars. A value in .env would therefore reach the test env too
# and override the OpenSearch host the Behat workflow provides.
PIMCORE_OPENSEARCH_DSN=opensearch://opensearch:9200?ssl=false&ssl_verify=false
